:- module mpimos_builtin_predicate.
:- public is_command/2,do_command/2,help/2.

is_command(true,	                  X):- true | X=yes.
is_command(unify(_,_),                    X):- true | X=yes.
is_command(add(_,_,_),                    X):- true | X=yes.
is_command(subtract(_,_,_),               X):- true | X=yes.
is_command(multiply(_,_,_),               X):- true | X=yes.
is_command(divide(_,_,_),                 X):- true | X=yes.
is_command(modulo(_,_,_),                 X):- true | X=yes.
